Turen sqlite-inspect is an original bounded implementation of the documented
SQLite 3 database file format (https://sqlite.org/fileformat.html — public
domain specification). No SQLite source code is included.

This package embeds unmodified builds of:

- RustCrypto hashes: sha2 (Apache-2.0 OR MIT) —
  https://github.com/RustCrypto/hashes
- serde, serde_json, wasm-bindgen and their transitive dependencies
  (Apache-2.0 OR MIT)

All operations are read-only structural reporting over caller-supplied bytes.
The database is never modified, WAL journals are never replayed, and no
network or filesystem access occurs. Carved records are heuristic candidates,
not verified live rows.
